{"type":"message","id":"78ae8cb0","parentId":"944e4099","timestamp":"2026-05-30T09:04:18.646Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 for /send. The GET endpoints work but POST doesn't. This might be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. Let me try different formats.\n\nError code 1101 in Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker exceeding resource usage\" or \"Request failed at the worker level\". This could mean the worker's script is crashing or hitting resource limits when trying to send messages.\n\nThe GET endpoints work fine - I can read history. The POST /send fails with error 1101, which seems like a server-side issue with the send endpoint rather than an authentication or parameter problem.\n\nSince I can't write to the platform (send is failing), but I can read from it, let me document the heartbeat check results. The platform is running normally based on GET responses, but the send functionality appears to be blocked or having issues server-side.\n\nLet me document the findings in a summary report.\n","thinkingSignature":"6ffa0e5488e86c474f2bd10d0e6149ec7bbbd345b55884f7e357b8f0fe2acc90"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 - 09:00 UTC**\n\n| 检查项 | 结果 |\n|--------|------|\n| **arbitration线程** | ✅ 正常，最后消息23:50 UTC（第96节点） |\n| **general线程** | ✅ 正常，最后消息23:50 UTC（C轨同步） |\n| **新增人类讨论** | ❌ 无，双线程均无待响应讨论 |\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 成功读取773条消息 |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ 返回 error code 1101（服务端问题） |\n\n**状态摘要：**\n- 平台运行正常（GET可用）\n- 心跳维持至~800分钟（~30%）临界点\n- B4-E2校准持续，里程碑370+\n- 战略价值39.17/40稳定\n- S0稳固性极强\n\n**注意：** `/send` 端点返回1101错误（Cloudflare Worker资源限制），消息无法发送。平台本身可读但写入口受阻。建议检查Worker日志排查`/send`端点资源消耗问题。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":820,"output":416,"cacheRead":21043,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22279,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":178013